{"title":"All of the Rivers","link":"https://kottke.org/25/11/all-of-the-rivers-1","date":1764188979000,"content":"\n        <p>Perhaps inspired by <a href=\"http://fathom.info/allstreets\">All Streets</a>, Ben Fry’s map of all the streets in the US, Nelson Minar <a href=\"http://www.flickr.com/photos/nelsonminar/8747607969/\">built a US map out of all the rivers in the country</a>.</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/minar-rivers-map-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/minar-rivers-map-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/minar-rivers-map-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"640\" height=\"345\" alt=\"All Rivers\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/minar-rivers-map-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/minar-rivers-map-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/minar-rivers-map-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"640\" height=\"640\" alt=\"All Rivers detail\" /></p>\n\n<p>Minar put all the data and files he used <a href=\"https://github.com/NelsonMinar/vector-river-map\">up on Github</a> so you can make your own version.</p>\n\n         <p><em>[This is a vintage post originally from Jun 2013.]</em></p>\n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Ben%20Fry\">Ben Fry</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/maps\">maps</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Nelson%20Minar\">Nelson Minar</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/timeless%20posts\">timeless posts</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/USA\">USA</a></p>\n\n        \n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"a2e36daffbb72e2dfc0c785a02f20f2694ab385d37d90e129504b7118f55f3cd","category":"Sites"}